></summary>\n\n- <picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-light.svg\"><img src=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-light.png\" alt=\"Medium severity\" width=\"62\" height=\"18\" align=\"texttop\"></picture> [Replace arbitrary five-pass cap with guarded convergence](#discussion_r4106379615) · New\n- <picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-light.svg\"><img src=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-light.png\" alt=\"Medium severity\" width=\"62\" height=\"18\" align=\"texttop\"></picture> [Normalize -C via pkgload before loading package closure](#discussion_r4106379661) · New\n- <picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-light.svg\"><img src=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-light.png\" alt=\"Medium severity\" width=\"62\" height=\"18\" align=\"texttop\"></picture> [Check Package.Errors across the loaded dependency closure](#discussion_r4106379705) · New\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary><strong>What changed in this PR</strong></summary>\n\nAdds iterative rule matching for dependencies introduced by injected hook packages.\n\n**Changes:**\n- Loads and matches injected dependency closures using build flags.\n- Moves the no-instrumentation warning after all matching passes.\n- Adds unit and integration coverage with a dedicated test application.\n\n| File | Description |\r\n| ---- | ----------- |\r\n| `tool/​internal/​setup/​setup.go` | Runs injected-dependency matching. |\r\n| `tool/​internal/​setup/​match.go` | Defers the empty-match warning. |\r\n| `tool/​internal/​setup/​inject.go` | Implements closure loading and iterative matching. |\r\n| `tool/​internal/​setup/​inject_test.go` | Tests injection matching helpers. |\r\n| `test/​integration/​injected_deps_test.go` | Verifies injected targets and build flags. |\r\n| `test/​apps/​injecteddeps/​otel.instrumentation.go` | Registers test instrumentation. |\r\n| `test/​apps/​injecteddeps/​main.go` | Provides the test application. |\r\n| `test/​apps/​injecteddeps/​instrumentation/​target/​target.go` | Defines an injected instrumentation target. |\r\n| `test/​apps/​injecteddeps/​instrumentation/​otelc.yaml` | Defines test instrumentation rules. |\r\n| `test/​apps/​injecteddeps/​instrumentation/​hook.go` | Implements the test hook. |\r\n| `test/​apps/​injecteddeps/​instrumentation/​go.mod` | Defines the instrumentation module. |\r\n| `test/​apps/​injecteddeps/​instrumentation/​extra/​extra.go` | Defines the build-tag target. |\r\n| `test/​apps/​injecteddeps/​instrumentation/​extra_on.go` | Enables tagged dependency access. |\r\n| `test/​apps/​injecteddeps/​instrumentation/​extra_off.go` | Handles builds without the tag. |\r\n| `test/​apps/​injecteddeps/​go.sum` | Records test application checksums. |\r\n| `test/​apps/​injecteddeps/​go.mod` | Configures test modules and tool dependency. |\n</details>\n\n---\n\n💡 <a href=\"/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go-compile-instrumentation/new/main?filename=.github/skills/code-review/SKILL.md\" class=\"Link--inTextBlock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Add a `code-review` agent skill</a> or configure MCP servers for context-aware, tailored 